    <item>
      <title>Bài 08 – WebSocket và giao tiếp thời gian thực</title>
      <link>https://phuocbap.github.io/LTM/posts/bai-08-websocket/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 25 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://phuocbap.github.io/LTM/posts/bai-08-websocket/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;1-websocket-là-gì&#34;&gt;1. WebSocket là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WebSocket là giao thức cho phép thiết lập kết nối hai chiều
giữa Client và Server thông qua một kết nối TCP duy nhất.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;2-đặc-điểm-của-websocket&#34;&gt;2. Đặc điểm của WebSocket&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kết nối hai chiều (full-duplex)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phù hợp cho ứng dụng thời gian thực&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Giảm độ trễ so với HTTP truyền thống&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;3-ví-dụ-websocket-client-javascript&#34;&gt;3. Ví dụ WebSocket Client (JavaScript)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;WebSocket&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;ws://localhost:8080&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;onopen&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; () =&amp;gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Đã kết nối tới WebSocket Server&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;};
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;onmessage&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;) =&amp;gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Server gửi:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;};
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;onclose&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; () =&amp;gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Kết nối đã đóng&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;};
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
